      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I mean ....yaaaa?\n\n\n\nThe atmosphere, sound design and CRTV mechanic are really good, and some of the monsters are genuinely creepy. But the game feels way too slow for me. Most objectives force you to search for items, solve puzzles and backtrack instead of letting you explore naturally.\n\n\n\nThe Weight is also a cool concept, but its AI sometimes feels like it knows exactly where you are, which can make it frustrating instead of scary. I wish there was more action involved......almost stopped like 3 times\n\n\n\nGood game, but I wouldn't pay €50 for it, roughly €15–20."
